{
  "title": "SonarQube Usage - Projects & Portfolios",
  "description": "Live quality snapshot plus analysis usage from the SonarQube Web API. KPI, issue, size, and table panels are current measures (they ignore the time picker). Trends use the time range and the single-select Project (history) variable. Portfolios require Enterprise/Governance.",
